  timer fed-raid-rom 60
  random fed-raid-rom-1 fed-raid-rom-2 fed-raid-rom-3 fed-raid-rom-4 fed-raid-rom-5 fed-raid-rom-6 fed-raid-rom-7 fed-raid-rom-8
